# question, how to gate a demo audience. It also opens by naming Pragma, and
# its re-entry conditions describe one real prospect's internal state closely
# enough that the name is not doing much work. It reached the public index on
# 29 August in the same pass as the reversal it came out of, and was caught
# before that commit was pushed, so it is not in the history. Tracked in
# orin-private from 2026-08-30.
notes/commercial-operating-model.md

